WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.714
The catalogue groups data into eleven themes. Here is what each one contains.

00:00:08.532 --> 00:00:12.121
Open Explore data to see the themes.

00:00:12.785 --> 00:00:21.068
Natural Basin Characteristic covers physiography, land cover, climate and 3D point clouds.

00:00:21.732 --> 00:00:28.410
Flood Monitoring and Early Warning holds real time flood detection and discharge forecasts.

00:00:29.077 --> 00:00:37.970
Drought Monitoring and Risk Assessment: rainfall deficit, soil moisture, vegetation stress and sectoral risk.

00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:45.400
Socio-Economic Profile has population, settlements and economic activity.

00:00:46.058 --> 00:00:53.477
Water Resources: rivers, gauges, dams, reservoirs and groundwater.

00:00:54.136 --> 00:01:00.409
Citizen Science brings community observations such as mini SASS and Fish Track.

00:01:01.073 --> 00:01:07.971
Water Use Monitoring and Analysis holds the water accounting and evapotranspiration layers.

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:13.979
Ecosystems covers environmental flows and ecological monitoring.

00:01:14.644 --> 00:01:21.262
Satellite Images offers Sentinel 2 composites and water observations from space.

00:01:21.921 --> 00:01:27.215
And Data Sources and Providers records where every layer comes from.

00:01:27.876 --> 00:01:31.020
Click Done to return to the map.

00:01:31.678 --> 00:01:37.852
Those are the eleven themes. The guide below lists the datasets in each.
